4) CashPayment.refund() will always throw UnsupportedOperationException at runtime if we remove the condition on instanceof CashPayment.
CashPayment violates LSP, because it claims to be a PaymentMethod but cannot support all operations promised by that abstraction.
instanceof is not a, acceptable fix because ParkingGarage becomes dependent on concrete payment classes. Every new special payment type may require another condition, violating OCP.

